The new iron oxide pigment production base of Shijiazhuang Shencai pigment factory has been put into production News
Shijiazhuang Shencai Pigment Factory founded in 2003.We have a large Iron Oxide Pigment Production Base (Hebei Chengyu Pigment Co. , Ltd), it is located in Ningjin Salt Chemical Industrial Park, Hebei Province, is a provincial chemical industrial park, is officially in production. With three production lines, annual production capacity of 50,000 tons.
The first iron oxide yellow production base was established in 2004, located in Guzhuang Industrial Park, Shangzhuang Town, Luquan District, Shijiazhuang, with an annual output of 10000 tons.
In 2016, in response to the national environmental protection policy, a new iron oxide pigment production base was established in Ningjin salt chemical industry park .In the same year, registered branch Hebei Chengyu Pigment Co., Ltd
In 2017, the annual output of 50000 tons of iron oxide production base was officially put into operation, including three iron oxide pigment production lines. Iron oxide yellow production line, iron oxide red production line, iron oxide black production line.
In 2020, we will actively upgrade environmental protection equipment and transform production workshops.
