3 local meats
The result is a delicious cream that you are served with shavings of ham or hard-boiled egg. Also, due to its composition and way of drinking it, experts include this recipe among those of Andalusian gazpachos.
But not everything is cold dishes in the typical food of Córdoba. It also has more hearty recipes that you will find delicious.
But more indigenous is the cordovan pot, a chickpea stew made with paprika, pork bacon, onion, garlic, salt and cabbage. As a forceful recipe that it is, it used to be prepared to feed day laborers, but, over time, it has become a classic of the gastronomy of the Andalusian province.
In his case, the recipe has been known since Roman times, although the current preparation dates back to the XNUMXth century. As its name suggests, it is prepared with bovine tail (bull or cow) and also has tomato, onion, carrot, pepper, garlic, salt and bay leaf.
The chanfaina is also appreciated, which is also made with lamb and its blood, onion, garlic, bay leaf and chilli pepper. But this recipe also belongs, with variations, to other spanish kitchens and even Latin American.
While in some areas they are hardly consumed, in others they are considered a delicacy. Among the latter is Córdoba, which has turned them into everything a banner of its gastronomy, to the point that they are even sold in street stalls.
In any case, the ingredients of Cordoban confectionery are honey, sesame and matalahúva. However, one of the most typical desserts of the Andalusian province is the cordovan cake, a delicacy made from angel hair and puff pastry.
In it you will find excellent wines.
In conclusion, we have shown you the ingredients and traditional dishes of the typical food of Cordoba.
If you are looking for a rental car, through the following search engine you can find what you need. Rental cars
Choose well the destination, the flight, the hotel ..., many things to take into account and that you have to choose well not to screw up. To all this must be added something very important: What to do if we have to travel long distances or visit different cities during our trip?
This type of car is being increasingly demanded by users who want to have an ideal and smooth trip. It is true that renting a car today is not a very attractive idea for many people, who are still unaware of its many benefits.
Moving as long as you want is something fantastic. Gone would be the concerns of the guy: what time does the bus leave?
Etc., which can become a real torture.
Another key is, without a doubt, the saving. Renting a car can cost about € 5-15 per day, something far below the cost of having to take several buses, taxis, etc., to move from one place to another.
If we spend a few moments of our valuable time browsing with our computer or Smartphone, we will see that the network is full of companies that are dedicated to this sector and from which we can make use of their services in a very simple way and totally online.
Budget is a Californian entity founded in the late 50s, which currently has more than 3000 offices located in 128 countries around the world. For its part, Avis is identified by being at our disposal a wide amalgam of vehicles of all types and conditions with which to satisfy any user.
As you can see in our rental car search engine, it shows us a small one with different gaps or blank boxes that we can fill in with the information that we are asked for.
And, finally, we will complete with the car features itself: type, model, etc. Of course, depending on the search engine we are facing, we have to offer one information or another, but as a general rule these are usually the details that are commonly required of us.
Renting a car without a credit card can be almost impossible, since the companies that carry out this work are not usually very friendly to the cash payment. The reason for this is very simple.
Said insurance will only be paid by the user in the event that this has caused a problem in the vehicle. Meanwhile, they remain guarded in what is known as Deposit, which is nothing more than the initial blocking of a certain amount of the total money available on the card, which will be released upon delivery of the car in perfect condition.
That is, different people rent their car through the company, with the sole purpose of making a profit. Through an advertisement, they establish the price and availability, and the interested parties contact them.
Finally, if you are going to need to rent a car for a very long period of time, perhaps the option of renting a Mercedes or any other premium brand will be better for you since they offer very competitive prices and after a while you can choose to renew it or return it without obligation.
