Hongyuan Wheel Group (HYWG) was founded in 1996 with its predecessor as Anyang Hongyuan Steel Co., Ltd (AYHY). HYWG is professional manufacturer of rim steel and rim complete for all kinds of off-the-road machinery, such as construction equipments, mining machines, forklifts, industrial vehicles.
The annual production capacity has reached 300,000 rims, products export to North America, Europe, Africa, Australia and other regions. HYWG is now the largest OTR rim producer in China, and aim to become top 3 OTR rim manufacturer in the world.
Originally as a small section steel manufacturer, HYWG started to produce rim steel since late of 1990’s, in 2010 HYWG became market leader in truck rim steel and OTR rim steel, market share reached to 70% and 90% in China; the OTR rim steel were exported to global rim producers like Titan and GKN. Since 2011, HYWG started to produce OTR rim complete, it became major rim supplier for global OEM like Caterpillar, Volvo, John Deere and XCMG.
We can produce all kinds of OTR rims including 1-PC, 3-PC and 5-PC rims. Size from 4” to 63” for construction equipment, mining machinery, forklifts, and industrial vehicles.
HYWG is producing both rim steel and rim complete, we produce everything in-house for all the rims below 51”.
We use world class welding machinery with semi-auto control system to ensure top and stable welding quality. We also introduced in-depth interface between rim base, flange and gutter to have the unbeaten welding quality.
Our e-coating line offers the best prime coating which meet thousands of hours anti-rust tests, the color and paint looks meet top OEM standard like CAT, Volvo and John Deere. We can offer both power and wet paint as top paints, there are more than 100 kinds of colors to choose.
HYWG has been the leading company in OTR rim industry regarding technology, production and testing. There are more than 200 engineering stuff among total 1100 employees engaged in development, production and technical support for section steel, rim steel and rim complete products.
As the largest and most important industry event in Asia, the fair Bauma CHINA is an international trade fair for construction machinery, building materials machines, construction vehicles and equipment, and is intended to the industry, the trade and the service providers of the construction industry and in particular to decision-makers of the procurement area. The fair takes place every two years in Shanghai and is open to trade visitors only.
HYWG OTR rim has been presented in XCMG latest powerful machines like largest wheel loader XC9350 and largest mining dump truck XDM100. XCMG released China's first super-tonnage electric wheel loader XC9350, made XCMG the only Chinese manufacturer and third in the world with the capability to produce 35-ton super-large loaders.
