Clear Jambs: Natural wood door frames without joints or knots. Corner Seal Pad: a small part, usually made of resilient material, used to seal water from getting between the door edge and the jambs, adjacent to the bottom gasket.
L ASTN F RAME TM components that power doors. From rot-proof exterior door jambs, to bottom sill sweeps, we make exterior door components that work better, install faster and last longer.
