In the inspection industry, machine vision has obvious advantages over human vision, because machine vision can observe micron-level targets at the same time, and is empowered by infrared thermal imaging technology, which can distinguish small targets and better investigate latent thermal hazards of machinery. .
Machine vision solves a very fundamental problem, instability, and can avoid the missed detection rate. And the machine vision inspection equipment has no fatigue problem, and the program set in the algorithm can be executed without error, which can greatly improve the controllability of the effect in the quality control.
