It is normally expressed as multiple of the bonus amount , for example 5x .
This may sound like you have bet vast sums in order to meet the wagering requirements .
Therefore , if you place winning bets , you can simply use the winnings from them to place more bets and work towards meeting the requirements .
For instance , often there will be stipulations about the odds on qualifying bets .
In other words , if you are placing bets with odds any lower than that , then the bet will not count towards the wagering requirements .
For example , you may have to use only accumulator bets with a minimum number of events and minimum odds .
Very often , you will have to meet the wagering requirements within a given timeframe .
However , all of this will be explained clearly in the bonus’ terms and conditions , so be sure to take the time to read them before accepting a bonus .
