Different from the single row deep groove ball bearing, double row deep groove ball bearing has two reinforced nylon cages inserted into a bearing from both side separately. The carrying capacity of the radial load of a double row deep groove ball bearing is 1.62 times of that of a counterpart single row bearing.
SHB mainly products double row deep groove ball bearing of 42 series. According to the requirements of the user, SHB are able to produce the double row deep groove ball bearing of advanced precision (P0,P6, P5) , various clearance groups, special vibration and noise requirements (Z1, Z2 or V1, V2).
Deep Groove Ball Non-Standard Bearings Deep Groove Bearing
Deep groove ball bearings are mainly used for bearing pure radial loads and can be capable of bearing certain axial loads. When deep groove ball bearings bear pure radial loads, he contact angle is zero.
