Deep groove ball bearing is a very popular type of rolling bearings. The basic type consists of an outer ring, an inner ring, a set of balls and a set of cage.
The 60, 62,63, 67, 68,69 and 1600 series deep groove ball bearings are mostly made of steel plate ram-shaped cage, but also engineering plastics cage and copper cage. The sealed bearing is equipped with special lubricating grease for bearings according to different usage conditions.
A deep groove ball bearing with a sealing ring (contact type), like 6200-RS, etc;
A deep groove ball bearing with a sealing ring (light contact type), like 6200-rz, etc;
The most popular self-aligning ball bearings are the double row self-aligning ball bearings, it consists of one outer ring that had a large spherical groove raceway, one inner ring that has double grooves, two ball sets and two cages. The merit of these bearings is self-aligning function that could accommodate the misalignment of two axes and shaft bending deflection.
Deep groove ball bearing is a very popular type of rolling bearings. The basic type consists of an outer ring, an inner ring, a set of balls and a set of cage.
Four-point contact ball bearing is a kind of double direction single row angular contact ball bearing. Due to the exceptional design of raceway grooves of inner ring and outer ring, there are two contact points between each raceway groove and a ball.
