Raw materials show a significant increase in bicycle manufacturers to adjust product prices
It is understood that in previous years, the price of raw materials for the bicycle industry is very stable, rarely showing significant shifts. But from the beginning of last year, many of the raw materials used for bicycles rose, and this year the price not only continued to rise, and the rate of increase is higher.
The manager of a bicycle company in Shenzhen said that the price was adjusted once in May this year, by about 5%, and again in November, also by more than 5%. There has never been an adjustment twice a year.
With the consumption of mid- to high-end bicycles as the main focus, profits are relatively high, so the impact of rising raw material prices and freight costs is not as great as other large parts of the bicycle consumption enterprises.
Ms. Cao informed the reporter that after the epidemic, there are many young people around like her, who started to enjoy cycling for fitness. It is understood that while consumers’ requests for bicycle products such as functionality and shape are gradually progressing, many bicycle manufacturers are facing increasingly fierce competition in the market and are focusing on planning for relatively high profits and more competitive mid- to high-end bicycles.
In the interview, the reporter understands that the current complex market environment is increasingly testing the operational capabilities of enterprises, the application of the domestic accumulation of years of complete bicycle industry chain advantages, accelerate product structure to improve, and gradually change the domestic bicycle industry in the past to low value-added products, is becoming the consensus of many domestic bicycle enterprises to develop.
